1
00:00:00,463 --> 00:00:02,723
(Sheldon:)Four glasses of water, please.

2
00:00:04,100 --> 00:00:05,570
(Sheldon:)Anything for you guys?

3
00:00:07,003 --> 00:00:09,943
(Leonard:)Can I use your phone?
Our car got stolen.

4
00:00:10,139 --> 00:00:12,109
(Waitress:)Why don't you ask Scotty
to beam you up?

5
00:00:15,611 --> 00:00:20,481
(Sheldon:)Scotty was on the original series
and we're Next Generation.

6
00:00:21,017 --> 00:00:23,777
(Sheldon:)So joke's on you.

7
00:00:27,123 --> 00:00:29,283
(Howard:)We're not with him.

8
00:00:33,863 --> 00:00:36,523
(Amy:)You can't pick something up
in outer space.

9
00:00:36,766 --> 00:00:38,236
(Amy:)In space, there is no up.

10
00:00:38,434 --> 00:00:41,494
(Penny:)Oh, yeah? Then how does
the sun come up every day?

11
00:00:43,506 --> 00:00:45,836
(Amy:)Hard to argue
with those kind of street smarts.

12
00:00:51,147 --> 00:00:54,477
(Bernadette:)Leonard and Sheldon have boxes of comics.
Why don't we go look at those?

13
00:00:54,684 --> 00:00:57,344
Oh, great. And then you will see,
I am not wrong.

14
00:00:57,553 --> 00:01:00,383
(Penny:)If we were in outer space,
anyone could pick up the hammer...

